    "The color shows in the avatar, the name and on the handoff screen. The boards look the same for both: warm is yours, cool is your opponent’s." : {
      "comment" : "A note explaining the colour of the avatar, the name, and the handoff screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "De kleur zie je in de avatar, bij de naam en op het overdrachtsscherm. De velden zien er voor jullie allebei hetzelfde uit: warm is van jou, koel van je tegenstander."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Цвет работает в аватаре, имени и на экране передачи. Поля у обоих одинаковые: тёплое — своё, холодное — противника."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The color shows in the avatar, the name and on the handoff screen. The boards look the same for everyone: warm is yours, cool is your opponent’s." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the colour, name, and handoff screen for the player.",
